# Copy to denylist.txt and add your own patterns. denylist.txt is gitignored:
# the terms it contains are themselves sensitive and must never be committed.
#
# Case-insensitive regular expressions, one per line. Blank lines and lines
# starting with "#" are ignored. scripts/check_denylist.py scans tracked text
# files with these and skips denylist.txt itself.
#
# Example (inactive):
# \binternal-project-name\b
# \bdeadbeef\b
